              "id": "43be3aaa-beba-4c80-bd74-322b42e7fd8c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Leisure &amp; Ancient Rome</strong></em> was written by J. P. Toner, published by Polity, October 15, 1998."
            },
            {
              "id": "88c0f451-8b0b-4de1-9440-648d7f163bfb",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "c5599916-c21a-45fb-b955-651ab69d972d",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>In this book Toner offers a new way of looking at Roman society at all levels, not just among the elite, by examining the imperial games and the baths as well as gambling, the taverns, theatre and carnivals.</em>"
            },
